			},
			"date": "2023-11-10T02:27:57.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> there are many good use cases for shadow dom!</p><p>ultra isolated content like data visualization, animated illustrations, ads, third-party widgets, video players, 3D objects…</p><p>these use cases are very specialized, and will only form a small percentage of most websites consist of</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
